// IntroString :
"P645788381" "I bring news of dire consequence, {HeroName}. Mot's creatures have acquired the Cask of Djer, an ancient artifact of arcane significance. Were it simply some trinket, I would not be concerned. However, it is my belief that the souls of Djer's followers are contained within the Cask. If the Banished Pantheon find a way to feed those souls to Mot, the dark god's power would expand tremendously.<br><br>There is still time to stay their hand. You must stop the Pantheon before they bring the Cask to their master. When you find the Cask, destroy it. Mot is powerful, but it will be unable to catch an unfettered spirit."
// AcceptString :
"P3783610049" "Destroy the Cask of Djer"
// SendOffString :
"P187409900" "The artifact is not far from here. Go swiftly, {HeroName}. I do not wish to contemplate the effects of the Cask's consumption."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2648797054" "Every moment of pause brings with it great risk, {HeroName}. Please do not delay; you must destroy the Cask immediately."
// TaskTitle :
"P1167840791" "<color deepskyblue>Ancient Souls</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P856364347" ""
// TeamRequiresFailedText :
"P2188400069" "<color orange>All members of your team must be VIP in order to play Dark Astoria content.</color>"

