"P2576539464" "We have a problem, {HeroName}. My fellow Midnighters have placed down protective wards in Dark Astoria, in order to create a relatively safe haven from Mot's corrupting influence.<br><br>Unfortunately, it appears that the Talons of Vengeance have discovered these wards, and are attempting to tear them down as we speak. I'm sure you can imagine what would happen if they succeeded."
// AcceptString :
"P233876272" "Protect the Midnighter Wards"
// SendOffString :
"P1715575345" "Please hurry, {HeroName}. Those wards represent one of the only safe havens we have in Dark Astoria. We can't afford to lose them."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1653137" "The wards are still in danger, {HeroName}. Please do not take this predicament lightly."
// TaskTitle :
"P2129161086" "<color deepskyblue>A Shelter in the Storm</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
