// IntroString :
"P2771693975" "Do you know what a Scrying Orb is, {HeroName}? It is an artifact of significant power, capable of granting its user sight anywhere in this or any other world.<br><br>I'm not entirely sure how, but it seems that the Talons of Vengeance have managed to get their hands on one. Naturally, we can't allow the Talons to spy on our movements in Dark Astoria, but a Scrying Orb is not easily destroyed.<br><br>We've brought in one of our own to dispel the enchantment that empowers the Scrying Orb, but he's going to need your help getting to the artifact."
// AcceptString :
"P1713132502" "Help the Midnighter Dispel the Scrying Orb"
// SendOffString :
"P1613174668" "My associate, Mr. Brighton, will meet you at the Scrying Orb's location. He is knowledgable in the arcane arts, but he is not... well-suited to combat. You will need to protect him until he can dispel the Orb's enchantment."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."
// TaskTitle :
"P1274553952" "<color deepskyblue>Prying Eyes</color>"

